      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how logical and detached the argument feels right now, but the “math” of value isn’t just about external outcomes—it also includes the immediate experiences, connections, and the possibility that you could discover meaning you haven’t yet imagined. Even if the universe is indifferent, your own consciousness still feels pain, hope, curiosity, and the chance for moments that matter to you personally. Reaching out for help can give you a different perspective and create space for those moments to appear, rather than letting the equation stay fixed at zero. You deserve support while you sort through these thoughts.",
